;; spend the same twenty minutes rediscovering them.
;;
;; Attribute names are `news.schema`'s `:news.source/*` (cloud-itonami/news).
;;
;; :news.source/credibility is an EDITORIAL WEIGHT used for ranking and for
;; breaking dedupe ties — it is not a claim about truthfulness. Vendor and
;; primary sources score high because they are first-party about their own
;; product, which is exactly what makes them a good citation and also what
;; makes them promotional; the channel's job is to cite them, not to believe
;; them.
;;
;; :newsfeed/has-summary false is measured, not assumed: those feeds ship an
;; empty or absent <description>, so a consumer gets a headline and a link and
;; must not be written as though a summary will be there.

